  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48fa8284fb87edf0137375a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当成踏出下一步的阶梯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a48ce7b1e8bf70dbc518d30b59382bfefe8d21fe88324390163a682dc64bced7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04d6d48e16ca583091b95c77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得重新审视该反省的地方……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63484ea51f91c0f9d18ea18bc80ab2868b2535054b07eac9fba3c11041b9e5f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ceae7ee18352db262c1c2b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕此刻离樱花的季节──\r\n还很遥远……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65326af078835f516c12b0b0f14b014ddf870ed85448cb1d3cb58b02e3a0d6d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a82b7edd02f94c17da6b94eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越过任何凛冽的冬天并绽放，\r\n才称得上是樱花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "daff26b918ea99dd5379e5814fd82bce88c30d9a8fc691136f214339e00606e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c68a892c70680d1d34efb30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是段幸福的时光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f170f00ddfcd87cdcd98fbff1e31bff5a66254d0a75bbfc787f86531cbe9d6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:569a3a99b0c8eccb6276d1d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就要开始了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a5b155aafd7a9e84f7e849d8362fa3bc8906126b4ab1965bdde454300b37c28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15d0b59c98ebfd7e19e7ee4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越过冬天，我就会盛开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d60d964f0f365d6f9af91e47f3d6ea202b8e4c6dc8533c617c05357da9b2e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f7cdc11c2278400898ff6f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟难得有机会\r\n能参加学园的活动嘛，\r\n一定要尽情乐在其中才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f46bcb8980127e986a22e2bcc9db49077753c96a18cf19e3b7219e24a30a2be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4e0c2244048ad2b9a2b04f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟大家在一起真开心……\r\n而且小仁也在！\r\n呵呵，必须好好帮忙才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "660a9179141de7c9dab654eb462e8ca6cefead89c9e23b8009d0e575b8ad3ecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a3239792fb11731af305ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我记得，以前和家人一起去\r\n法国旅行时……我因为看灯饰\r\n看得太兴奋，还发烧了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "144b49aabe8fc5066fb89392b8d55f3a0ad86fb365efe11341c74b96f6bc2abb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c8c8989d287f0fdc188c84c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光是乐在其中或许我还无法满足。\r\n我想和一路上一起努力过来的……\r\n这五个人获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d21d4da0cdb630945bc88bbbad866cf74992b71c34db07d0328a1370445d00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc5a3deb83f70cd8cef191d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抓住、超越、化为力量──\r\n直到完全绽放的那天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95545691fa361bbc0dbec8aac19a7471f265a20c6674c86087b8f48844b342a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3208d4e12e28e70f40a2ebf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "化朗塔真漂亮。\r\n我也能像那样绽放光芒吗？\r\n……不，我一定要绽放光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92016c0288ed389bba8ab964141b9709449687f5bdd6dc209a50dcad97378b7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eb73b0933140bf80ef1d76d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这些是活动任务！\r\n积极地完成吧！\r\n跟我一起喊～胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "225dad6949ace47c9ec83d411f028bef0728954f94499e4b04b44823dfbc7ba6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:972d53121c071377c8025a09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了！你这么努力，\r\n之后要好好让身体休息喔。\r\n约好啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e737916a5c06036d9801759102273049d2a0d535864ef865327402241cd34975",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5829ee1bbcdbd2bef49d6350",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会成功！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a17d362a85308653059d512d3c62c7a1a019137cda7ccbff914dc6ec2468f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b9e792c4716417337866fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0730e92a8deba053152e1d3bf7fe894dd2618c27fe49325439213a1fc330f2c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38d1cb131c94241bfbef4c00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb3fc1e5fcce5a59bea6d6647879efdb4ac491bee777c3de6d1ad14c5a54ba7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f9b3e8e61d438b943087b5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb3fc1e5fcce5a59bea6d6647879efdb4ac491bee777c3de6d1ad14c5a54ba7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0a611abbe616ae27db45371",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf6bf10b3daac566622d808cf4ff4a2bda9d902b2653c576dcc18dfdb91e6b4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d56f976ae5ea75aab59f71fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf6bf10b3daac566622d808cf4ff4a2bda9d902b2653c576dcc18dfdb91e6b4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:757bd6a5930f53e755860cc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对不起……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a228f4c70cc0347268384ed24614e77c1d969fbcbe57d8162f8e86aa7bc671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a342ff8b20c6dbca83c407c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对不起……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a228f4c70cc0347268384ed24614e77c1d969fbcbe57d8162f8e86aa7bc671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd636ed04f6710f192ea40f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对不起……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a228f4c70cc0347268384ed24614e77c1d969fbcbe57d8162f8e86aa7bc671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ba31e61bc09712ea4ecd116",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要出发去华丽且轻巧地起舞啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16fada16fec656863c592b55746c25e2518b2e34b7fe0446259fa6b6fbb88ebb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e5d44d7233492b4ed7e4ce5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等一下可以请你告诉我，\r\n我哪个部分表现不错吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1130f6c3c4815879884913bfa990242e5af3c7b2381e72e29390cb072c7a07ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ddb981f3639f7c18cbbadc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你愿意跟我一起做梦吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d8c561b7db0af2bd61aeb9f3b9b88dd5c0d7d93565c48e03a71bd8a44d5a4b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80d5e403d70884f1fdf625e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你与无法跑步的我一起实现了\r\n梦想……无论迎来了多少次春天，\r\n我都不会忘了这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88768001e26d9acb756ec6bd8f4c27b717eb2c1b5ab296a26ec6b03caf2df9ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a52c9056949d3712d43f555",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在学园度过的快乐时光，\r\n是我珍贵的宝物！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d10e571404b5dca357a9056b199ef75197ea97412e2d002e1e4c91c594f47205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8796821356a83b4b9dede5f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会跟比赛一样，\r\n不知道会发生什么事呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c14e8c5712b2eaa7c4acbe9396c7fd68722bbab535c7b80a6504ca641ff743d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1361f5cab1c6fff3e988a1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花盛开！只要穿着这套决胜服，\r\n就绝不会凋零！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d76d6ca3874c39bebb781bcd50677a4ecca343f2dc33bfd0759f913c704102",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ab2452b33c4ac78d1a5201a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我终于习惯这套制服了。\r\n虽然比大家慢了一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24201b6332ed4c1c6eb6d4ccdeed9b27bc3ef7c2c8a00f06871d24bca3430958",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:644b885a10af9fdfe0a42afa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢华丽的歌曲，\r\n就像蝶群翩翩起舞那样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94848e611e944870de07a9fa1cd6d3c541e8c13ed61a34a1418d455c35c70157",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73313cc2b25627f058141caa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，总共有几朵樱花呢？\r\n请来找找看吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "acf85490e9a14ef79b15ac9bfe1351885e664dc3ed163a60edc878a6441cf89e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b8d26355d053b6ad3b57657",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服的设计很出色对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ce6117f85a4e192ae502d5e87d7759669a6e868fcac0b7c7b0a78906992b13b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4f1ef990a3e1aaa5f1e0811",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喜爱的服装又要变多了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef7b378ba7069e2b8dceabe6b294bdb87f48f78701b1c4446aac221ad5f2fb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fed986a6a8ebb354c76faa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "足元は温かくしてるんです。\r\nいつでも調子を整えられるように！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb7c219d94573bd5f8b246d7190e427a66d7fa1d97d19a5ba4f25a695bbee10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f3ae8416f92b6bac7fc1eb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かばんの中身ですか？フランス語の\r\n本と…あとは秘密です♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7a4f4a7c8007edf6fea31fcb420bb2320cef3410a75d5684f7d3052198184e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
