    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c3117523cd2e6c816d1c400",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喜爱的服装又要变多了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef7b378ba7069e2b8dceabe6b294bdb87f48f78701b1c4446aac221ad5f2fb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40a88f1f31173a1e84226eba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7353978df273aaabd070bbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "预备～一起喊！胜利～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb9a2cd4da88854a7241f2e63619c746374853c1ca6f7fa1fbd9ae948435b867",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "8007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:285cfaac8d33d871fd2f71f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n今天也要尽全力做好\r\n今天所能做到的事哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0f7d9fec847b00ecb21d7b42c23c5e54681c594e89831557fddfc55104e4b79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829974c8d848368752906941",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的早餐是爸爸亲传，\r\n从法国学来的奥姆蛋！\r\n美味又充满营养。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4718d2b7d35ed52dfec4f555d70ff988f8ba155528257b91101f5aa6325bacac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c31beee14a4869917d193004",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还在胜利俱乐部的时候，\r\n我也会替每个人做好中午的便当，\r\n再带过去呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde6c3d3f95226f33c4fa31592b0f077380ed2d9a26032b57a291044264e3d87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3e7bb0a073e9f7e62cd73b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简单来说，食堂的推荐菜色\r\n就是色拉！健康又美味，\r\n让人忍不住一口接一口！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b602065b32e0975a07b6c14b67f04bd359aa46f555bb143c22aa389c3995538f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10a634756b17e74dca1b627b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～要买新的还是重打呢……\r\n啊，我是在说蹄铁！因为我都会\r\n在睡前配合状态进行维护。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89afa6445157aea1b0237aba18b44b5bb3190cd8c88549c9a02ae0e5e2414fcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe2fce49ac81d752ec524f76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明白自己的极限在哪里，\r\n可是非常重要的一件事呢。\r\n意思就是……绝不能逞强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5a7bb86dfd577289c57c72b782826c44c3ad31ef6f25030cf0e2723936fe3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65b86e63ab9b6813f4c035d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的樱花也开花了。\r\n挺过了漫长的冬天，凛然绽放……\r\n嗯，这果然是我最爱的花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f09df8200e6511dbbe524bb3682f40948fff26eb1a0470aeaf080e02543e695e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd58b3bd9ecf083b553c4016",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天是个会让人期待泳池训练的\r\n季节呢！而且对脚的负担也不大，\r\n真是一箭双鵰♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "469c087a90731fc19017c7a9ceb02f2ce0526c8ae4e925035b40580559843703",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba0f511d83658e114d83e8ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸寄了法国的香菇来给我！\r\n要拿来煸炒吗？但是下点工夫\r\n做成浓汤也很不错呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2f9cdeefde1312c4d5aed9726b76a845da1bcdb95f73be575a53e29176a9c99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bb4a770fa69fa7d8bccc8b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肌肉如果没做好热身，\r\n会成为受伤的原因……对吧？\r\n所以我要去稍微练跑一下啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9fb709c45c01e3b5f38585b273608082c5c682a20d3fe036fcc8fe0d651c461",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33e6affb53977507c0e394db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01241030a2958216d802b541",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利俱乐部是我的原点！\r\n不管在难过还是懊悔的时候，\r\n这里都能让我积极地放眼梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee58be8e6e4563281bc75422fb17ce767642068fe88128b3a52665c4d1f5d172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1597edb6df4c2013c668926",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我受父母的影响开始做法式料理……\r\n虽然还没办法做出全餐，\r\n但对咸派跟火上锅还是很有自信！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f31be0e41b7338138dc9ef737234a5af9c2f19992c2ebd432a9fddc3e4f4ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fe35ecba815ac8d79338b64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小仁的比赛我全都有录像哦！\r\n虽然之前有一次被她本人发现，\r\n差点被逼着处理掉就是了……耶嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3350a7ecf4af8da948a2bda8b641e97d404f1dcb7ce7980ca1ae80fcd92a20b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ea8fe13a38810c43d8ac5fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对缠绕绷带的方法很有自信哦。\r\n因为缠上松开了无数次，\r\n便相对地越来越得心应手了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d389746727ff6690f04bbdb5c885951abf0c8b3a2d4d3b2447abd171cd9d521",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88346973a8c3976fbe3438c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有点怕游乐园的尖叫类设施……\r\n跟飞机起飞时，\r\n五脏六腑浮荡的那种感觉很像。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5640350dde5fd6eb789508ffe295c7cc20500fef51bc87b722bb365b4e8760c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26456752567028dd5c3f85e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一穿上跟大家同款的服装，就会\r\n深刻感受到我终于站上了这里……\r\n站上同一个舞台！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b287f40e27a36663bf64e5945e6b35eeae77a2ae888d74a80c787b52e3f7baf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06ab97b40c325aa8f6bd892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得颜色很可爱吗？像是由红、\r\n白、蓝组成的三色旗……咦？这是\r\n紫色……？这、这么一说还真的是！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f276f904d8ca7ea1fe6e347719a60faef37433e4bd710e40fdf512b34182c882",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ff12da5389be5ef77014e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "月桂冠是胜利的象征。\r\n我想摘下不辱这顶冠冕……\r\n不辱此名的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b0ae33f8f42285e602a9d3934619af935eb19e2233bf492ddde983eb606c411",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f0accfbda39f1b960c9393",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟胜利俱乐部的大家\r\n同款的服装……不只可爱，\r\n还是热血又坚强的樱花色！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa3843a1061f6ad401208d56bb20be7ea287b594f84dd7583923fb72c1854a2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f1c1f29450fbc19f63d2ba2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感到难过时就看看旭日吧！\r\n不管发生什么事，早晨都必会到来。\r\n这是件理所当然却又伟大的事呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8d78cf4e020a32c20aca3db9e788821f087f36224e0ab5894e11336d84a55cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0bda54e0640e6ab474ec0fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要跟小重一起喝下午茶，最后\r\n大概都会变成在聊小仁的话题呢。\r\n真是不可思议！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce34c15931c9e359714726bdd2fe9f1529be93b6d12f8fc4a28cb403a52f668c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a647dced4e45dcfc2f89df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近很热衷躲在被窝看法文书……\r\n但很容易就不小心睡着，\r\n这或许是比较伤脑筋的地方？",
      "source_fingerprint": "db745a9af2c8e35c404b4635b629326ea9d0d3e413dc3a3053e03edfda23c194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:485f9d167d3b67bc555f231e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花朵坚忍撑过冬天后绽放的季节……\r\n嗯，春天果然很美好呢。\r\n我最爱的樱花也会在此时盛开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3560b7baafcf0b381e4e1ee6ad574d2436f26eeef516a3866018744ac4978a5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a822cdc53e66822eb04a7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有什么推荐的防晒乳吗？\r\n最近小空去钓鱼回来后，\r\n脖子后面常常都红通通的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f7163871c6674be781e0db7e3c58e83b25b876a42f96f574e86bfc52f4b40cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8760b4d43270adde542a706",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽快换衣服，还要立刻拿出毛毯。\r\n呵呵，这些都是在\r\n换季时不会感冒的秘诀喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d276e4f331ec86a696218f12f3fec5750cd101d57c9c2b7b095dc4f136b6e02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa6f65ef3fd71b365d70813c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天好玩的活动太多了……\r\n得注意不要玩得太过头，\r\n像小时候一样发烧了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91b65516d94d1a74822762a458d0862b70f225f5bea063b15280fa42da1bfabb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e71574a0352d2dce8baa85f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确实做好现在能做的事！\r\n积极地努力完成吧！\r\n跟我一起喊～胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba64bae6cf7a97632cf0e55fdf830af77a7d6f33cb20c1595400956b03add68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0904332784cc270b73426be0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よしっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e28360c52fb9c3f6b9a96c8e4ece7924de57f6ba6cc2f1e53636e02353838c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:511b37961d3554ca12576c0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也让我们去细细品味\r\n能够进行训练的幸福吧。\r\n──呵呵，真是开心呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2b7a3a0d7157ffa6d623df654bd914f0ff2da0396040a98368e99479afde116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee957b0d08199d7ac5e4e693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蹄铁的状态也万无一失。\r\n因为我在训练前，\r\n已经好好调整过了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "060fb0ade1b96ac8f40aee835c1de912273c5884c2794bc7b30439a0c1cfbf40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d881aa5a901e7f3d161223",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「只要持续磨萝卜就会变萝卜泥」，\r\n所以今天也要爆进！\r\n……开玩笑的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e9d5b60104e0d815ad1cc4ed023867eac346e45cf9a748f67b825492f15002c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "92003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
